equirement_states), task description, execution_constitution, go_style_constitution, constraints, shared_protocols, package_contracts\n   - The task specifically says: \"Add differential test cases for srd036-mktemp R4.3, R4.4\" with AC2 requiring \"Each of R4.3, R4.4 has at least one DiffTest entry exercising its specified behavior\"\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Add new DiffTest entries to `cmd/mktemp/mktemp_test.go` for R4.3 coverage (additional scenarios or edge cases not yet covered)\n   - Add test entries that explicitly demonstrate R4.4 compliance (no exact filename comparison)\n   - Run `go vet ./cmd/mktemp/` to verify no issues\n   - Run `go test ./cmd/mktemp/ -count=1` to verify all tests pass\n\n8. Current Work:\n   I had just finished reading both required files (`srd036-mktemp.yaml` and `cmd/mktemp/mktemp_test.go`) and was about to plan and implement the test additions. I was analyzing which R4.3 scenarios might need additional test entries beyond what the prior task already added, and how to explicitly satisfy R4.4.\n\n   The existing test file already covers all scenarios listed in R4.3 (default, -d, custom template, --suffix, -p, -t, -u, error cases). However, some potential gaps or additions:\n   - Combination tests (e.g., -t with -d for legacy mode + directory)\n   - Additional error cases for invalid templates (e.g., template with embedded slash)\n   - TMPDIR interaction edge cases\n   - Tests that more explicitly demonstrate R4.4 (normalizer-based comparison without exact filename matching)\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Add new DiffTest entries to `cmd/mktemp/mktemp_test.go` that strengthen R4.3 and R4.4 coverage. Based on the task requirement: \"Add differential test cases that verify srd036-mktemp R4.3 behavior against gmktemp\" and \"Add differential test cases that verify srd036-mktemp R4.4 behavior against gmktemp\". The existing tests appear comprehensive, but I should add targeted entries that explicitly trace to R4.3's listed scenarios and R